# C4: Spring Boot loads EnvironmentPostProcessors from spring.factories only. The former
# META-INF/spring/org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor.imports was never read, so the post-processor
# below never ran and /actuator/health reported DOWN without Redis. Spring Boot 4 moved the interface (and so the
# key) from org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor to org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor.
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
io.helixiam.authorization.session.QueueSessionEnvironmentPostProcessor,\
io.helixiam.authorization.session.RedisServiceLinkEnvironmentPostProcessor
